---
const faqs = [
  { q: 'Is the Tucson facility closed?', a: "Yes, for the time being. The building on East Pima Street is not admitting while we work toward reopening it. Our Chandler facility is open and admitting every day, including holidays." },
  { q: 'When will Tucson reopen?', a: "We are working on it, and we will announce a date once it is one we can stand behind rather than one we hope for. Call and ask — admissions will tell you honestly where it stands, and we can let you know when it changes." },
  { q: 'How far is Chandler from Tucson?', a: "Roughly a two-hour drive north on the I-10. It is a longer trip than anyone would choose, but it is a very well-worn route and plenty of people from Tucson, Vail, Oro Valley and Marana make it." },
  { q: 'Can you help me get to Chandler?', a: "Raise it on the call. Ask about airport pickup if you are flying in, and for other journeys we will work through the practicalities with you rather than leaving transport as your problem alone. Some insurance plans also cover medical transport — worth asking about." },
  { q: 'What if I need to stay in Tucson?', a: "Then say so early and we will help you find a programme there. We will check your coverage first so the suggestions are ones you can actually use, and there is no cost or expectation attached to that." },
  { q: 'I was treated at Buena Vista Tucson before. Are my records still there?', a: "Call the admissions line and we will point you to the right person for records requests. Being a former resident also means you already know how we work, which makes coming back to Chandler a shorter conversation." },
  { q: 'Do you serve the rest of southern Arizona?', a: "Anyone from Tucson, Vail, Oro Valley, Marana, Green Valley, Sierra Vista or Nogales is welcome to call. What we can offer varies with how far you can travel, and the call will make that clear quickly." },
];
---
<section id="tucson-faq" class="bg-cream py-[70px]">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-gold font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-6 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>
      Straight answers
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-charcoal mb-10">Questions about Tucson</h2>
    <div class="divide-y divide-cream-soft border-t border-b border-cream-soft">
      {faqs.map(f => (
        <details class="group py-5">
          <summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 cursor-pointer">
            <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-charcoal text-[18px] leading-[28px]">{f.q}</h3>
            <span class="shrink-0 mt-1 text-teal">
              <svg class="faq-plus w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
              <svg class="faq-minus w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="font-body text-charcoal text-[16px] leading-[27px] mt-4 pr-10">{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
